{"availability":"available","full":"Jany-M/repo-visualizer","name":"repo-visualizer","description":"A visual representation of the progress history of a repository","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":12,"forks":3,"created":"2026-05-17T18:35:46Z","updated":"2026-08-30T17:37:37Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://repovisualizer.netlify.app/","topics":["codebase","data-visualization","history","repository","visualization","visualizer"],"demo":"https://repovisualizer.netlify.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:10.095Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:10.095Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:10.095Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T11:07:10.095Z","stars":12,"forks":3}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A cinematic timeline of your codebase. Watch a repository grow from its first commit to its latest state.","Repo Visualizer reads and visualizes a git repository's full history, extracts the import graph between files at every commit, and renders the evolving structure as an animated force-directed network. Each top-level directory is a feature cluster, each file is a node sized by code churn, each import is an edge. A commit advances the timeline and triggers a ripple from every touched file."],"features":["Growth over time - nodes appear and disappear as you move through history; the timeline scrubs quickly with a virtualized scrubber","Final state - jump to the end of history in one action (toolbar button or End key); large repos show a progress bar while the graph catches up","Canvas navigation - scroll or pinch to zoom, drag to pan; on phones and tablets use one finger to pan and pinch to zoom on the graph. Auto fit (on by default) keeps the growing graph in view while playback runs","File inspector - click a node to see import dependencies (Depends on / Imported in) and recent commits that touched it","Legend focus - click a cluster in the legend to highlight that folder and dim everything else; click again or press Esc to clear"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Jany-M/repo-visualizer/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3d61ec57123f1db89cdb9c04b3f50735017c1d0f76bff04f2fadf118ca091a53","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:10.190Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:10.190Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A cinematic timeline of your codebase. Watch a repository grow from its first commit to its latest state.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Jany-M/repo-visualizer/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"scripts/analyze.mjs walks the git log in chronological order.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Jany-M/repo-visualizer/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"3d61ec57123f1db89cdb9c04b3f50735017c1d0f76bff04f2fadf118ca091a53","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Jany-M/repo-visualizer/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:10.191Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-30T17:37:37Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Jany-M/repo-visualizer/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:10.191Z","hash":"3d61ec57123f1db89cdb9c04b3f50735017c1d0f76bff04f2fadf118ca091a53","originalBytes":11295,"storedBytes":11295,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["canvas","commit","graph","each","node","cluster","demo","export","gif","repo","timeline","every","history","one","path","src","state","webm","zoom","app","click","dataset","engine","file","large","theme","webgl","animated","bash","commits","drag","end","four","git","import","info","legend","mobile","npm","pan","pinch","playback","project","repos","repository","repovisualizer.config.json","ripple","root","themes","via","visualizer","when","while","action","active","analyze","analyze.mjs","analyzer","auto","backward","clear","config","d3-force","data","default","directory","esc","fallback","final","finger","fit","focus","format","frame","galaxy","g